error[E0546]: two arrays of different lengths cannot be compared: 2 elements and 6 elements
 --> test-code/errors/wasm/E0546-comparison-array-length-mismatch.mu:8:13
  |
6 |     x := [const]Int { 1, 2 }
7 |     y := [SIZE * 2]Int { .. = 0 }
8 |     same := x == y
  |             ^ this array has 2 elements
8 |     same := x == y
  |                  ^ this array has 6 elements
9 |     return 0
  |
  = note: arrays are compared element by element, so they must have as many elements, and the length
          of an array is known when the program is compiled
  = help: compare slices of the parts that have the same length, as in 'a[0:2] == b[0:2]'
